### Ingest the configured docs (Boot 4.1.1 Testing + Data) into pgvector. Takes about a minute.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ingestion/runs

### Ask a question. Calls Claude: needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in the app's environment (costs a few cents).
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What are the steps to implement springboot 4 ai agent?"
}

> {% client.global.set("runId", response.body.runId); %}

### Trace of the last run: every model call and tool call with tokens, cost and latency
GET http://localhost:8080/api/agent/runs/{{runId}}

### Answer a paused run. Send this only when the previous response was 202 WAITING_FOR_USER (pendingQuestion says what Claude asked).
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agent/runs/{{runId}}/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "Spring Boot 4.1 with Testcontainers"
}

> {% client.global.set("runId", response.body.runId); %}
